  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> While using the charming purr, enemies within your purring aura suffer a -1 penalty on saving throws made against charm and compulsion effects you create. In addition, you gain a +2 bonus on skill checks made to improve the attitude of a creature within your purring aura (such as using Diplomacy or Intimidate).</p>\n<p><strong>Powerful Purring:</strong> The charming purr’s penalty and bonus increase to -2 and +6 respectively.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/purring-feats#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
